   "type": "text",
   "kind": "section",
   "layout": "section",
   "html": "<h2>Part I: AIncense</h2>"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "large-language-objects/large-language-objects_01.jpg",
   "width": 2400,
   "height": 1389,
   "lqip": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
   "tone": "#5f5e61",
   "caption": "Inspiration: Could traditional rituals inform emerging technologies?",
   "layout": "wide-r",
   "kind": "photo"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "html": "<h3>AIncense is a praying device powered by ChatGPT, designed to amplify self-motivation through psychological suggestion.</h3><p>AIncense integrates the comprehensive capabilities of ChatGPT to revolutionize and expand our perception of religious authority. This innovative platform empowers users to foster a routine of self-empowerment and inspiration. Whether making a wish, confessing, or navigating daily life, AIncense provides a unique space for personal reflection and growth.</p>",
   "kind": "text"
  },
  {
