     "flex": 0.5,
     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "html": "<h3>AIncense 2.0 (Locally deployed LLM)</h3><p>In Fall 2024, I had a chance to revisit this project, and made a hardware design that truly enables this interaction. With the support from MIT HAN Lab, I was able to make a smart incense that locally communicates with Large Language. Please click the following links to see detail for the 2nd Iteration:</p>",
       "kind": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "html": "<h3><strong><a href=\"https://fab.cba.mit.edu/classes/863.23/Harvard/people/Kai/index.html#final\">&gt;&gt;&gt; Overview</a></strong><br><strong><a href=\"https://fab.cba.mit.edu/classes/863.23/Harvard/people/Kai/index.html#final_tracking\">&gt;&gt;&gt; Process Documentation</a></strong></h3>",
       "kind": "text"
      }
     ]
    },
